WEBVTT

00:02:07.616 --> 00:02:10.080
We stand in awe before that which
cannot be seen...

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:14.240
…and we respect with every fiber
that which cannot be explained.

00:02:27.390 --> 00:02:29.824
I sense strong Spirit Energy close by.

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:36.576
So the knife waved down...

00:02:37.410 --> 00:02:39.968
"BLEACH Episode 1"

00:02:41.059 --> 00:02:42.368
What are you doing?

00:02:42.656 --> 00:02:44.627
Kick Yama down
before explaining anything.

00:02:44.627 --> 00:02:45.792
What the hell do you want?

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:51.552
That’s all you got to say?

00:02:53.832 --> 00:02:54.762
Look！

00:02:55.648 --> 00:02:56.608
Oh my God!

00:02:56.864 --> 00:02:59.168
-Isn't he crazy?
-It hurts...

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:00.800
Shut up.

00:03:01.472 --> 00:03:04.064
Listen up pond scum!

00:03:06.752 --> 00:03:09.632
First question,
what do you think that is?

00:03:09.632 --> 00:03:10.944
You, the one in the middle, answer!

00:03:12.064 --> 00:03:13.536
Huh? What?

00:03:13.984 --> 00:03:17.600
I guess somebody left those flowers
for some kid who got wasted here.

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:18.944
Correct.

00:03:19.168 --> 00:03:20.192
Ame.

00:03:20.928 --> 00:03:21.792
Now the next question,

00:03:22.112 --> 00:03:24.928
why’s that vase lying on its side?

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:27.440
I guess one of us knocked it over when
we were skateboarding through here.

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:30.330
We didn’t mean it.

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:31.200
Damn it.

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:32.576
Dare try again...

00:03:32.960 --> 00:03:33.952
the next time

00:03:33.952 --> 00:03:37.088
the flowers will be for you!

00:03:39.072 --> 00:03:41.143
Sorry...

00:03:43.899 --> 00:03:45.088
That ought to keep those punks...

00:03:45.430 --> 00:03:46.848
from showing their
ugly faces around here.

00:03:48.704 --> 00:03:49.568
Sorry about all that

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:51.680
I’ll bring you some
fresh flowers tomorrow

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:54.400
Thank you for coming to my defense.

00:03:55.104 --> 00:03:57.696
I think I’ll finally be able to
rest peacefully now.

00:04:00.352 --> 00:04:01.536
No problem.

00:04:03.264 --> 00:04:04.608
After all you deserve to rest in peace.

00:04:06.336 --> 00:04:07.872
My name is Ichigo Kurosaki.

00:04:08.128 --> 00:04:09.312
I’m fifteen years old
and a high school student.

00:04:09.312 --> 00:04:10.240
“Kurosaki Clinic”

00:04:10.240 --> 00:04:11.424
My family runs a medical clinic
here in town.

00:04:13.376 --> 00:04:15.904
Maybe it’s because we’re entrusted with
the lives of the living.

00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:18.560
I’m not sure…

00:04:19.328 --> 00:04:21.216
but for as long as I can remember...

00:04:21.792 --> 00:04:23.840
I’ve been able to see the souls of
the dearly departed.

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:28.288
I’m home…

00:04:28.288 --> 00:04:29.728
So late.

00:04:31.392 --> 00:04:32.636
You bad boy.

00:04:32.636 --> 00:04:35.872
According to the family rules, our
family has dinner at 7 o'clock every day.

00:04:36.288 --> 00:04:37.248
Dad,

00:04:37.248 --> 00:04:40.416
is that any way to welcome your own son

00:04:40.416 --> 00:04:41.568
when he just risked his life to
help a spirit find peace!?

00:04:41.568 --> 00:04:43.968
Silence! Whatever the reason,

00:04:43.968 --> 00:04:45.952
anyone who destroys our family reunion

00:04:45.952 --> 00:04:47.584
will be punished, okay?

00:04:48.064 --> 00:04:49.184
Or you mean that you are the boss...

00:04:49.184 --> 00:04:50.848
just because you see ghosts

00:04:50.848 --> 00:04:51.840
and talk to them...

00:04:51.840 --> 00:04:53.250
and I don’t doesn’t make you boss
of this household!

00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:54.912
Hey it’s not my fault.

00:04:54.912 --> 00:04:56.736
Hey, stop the fighting you two!

00:04:56.864 --> 00:04:58.496
Come over here and eat your dinner!

00:04:58.496 --> 00:04:59.808
Let them fight.

00:04:59.808 --> 00:05:00.736
More rice for me.

00:05:00.736 --> 00:05:02.230
That’s not very nice Karin.

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:09.184
Anyway Dad for any normal healthy high-
school kid

00:05:09.184 --> 00:05:11.808
a 7 o’clock curfew is totally uncool!

00:05:11.808 --> 00:05:14.656
And speaking of uncool
you have a new one Ichigo.

00:05:16.448 --> 00:05:17.952
How long have you been there?

00:05:18.272 --> 00:05:19.424
Geez how do you get rid of these things!

00:05:19.424 --> 00:05:20.448
Damn...

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:22.080
I’m done

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:23.008
Get away.

00:05:23.584 --> 00:05:26.624
Poor Ichigo
Dad or ghosts, it’s always something.

00:05:26.816 --> 00:05:29.200
I think he’s kinda lucky to
be able to see the ghosts!

00:05:29.696 --> 00:05:32.704
I sorta sense their presence sometimes
but that’s about it.

00:05:33.504 --> 00:05:34.400
I tell you

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:36.768
I don’t see what the big deal is
with ghosts... I don’t even believe.

00:05:37.696 --> 00:05:39.872
I don’t get how you could say that
You had the power to see spirits too!

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:42.368
At home, only dad has no feeling at all

00:05:43.552 --> 00:05:45.140
I’m in permanent denial...

00:05:45.140 --> 00:05:47.296
just seeing them doesn’t make me
believe them.

00:05:49.408 --> 00:05:50.272
Brrr, that’s really cold!

00:05:52.736 --> 00:05:53.664
Li-ike dinner.

00:05:56.096 --> 00:05:57.280
You dropped your guard again!

00:06:04.896 --> 00:06:06.080
Never mind dinner, I’m going to my room.

00:06:07.744 --> 00:06:08.672
Ichigo!?

00:06:10.816 --> 00:06:12.480
Dad did you get dropped on
your head as a child?

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:13.504
Me?! What did I do?

00:06:17.568 --> 00:06:20.064
Ichigo is kinda having
a rough time right now.

00:06:20.704 --> 00:06:24.064
Yeah, He said he’s seeing more spirits
lately than ever before.

00:06:24.170 --> 00:06:25.030
What?!

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:27.808
Why would he talk about these things
with you two...

00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:29.280
instead of coming to his own dad?
That doesn’t make sense!

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:30.784
Sure it does.

00:06:31.008 --> 00:06:32.160
For one thing you’re over forty

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:35.520
and for another, emotionally you’re
still at a pre-school level.

00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:36.480
Dad, admit it.

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:38.720
Oh my dear wife

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:42.496
maybe they’re hitting puberty but
our daughters are being so cold to me!

00:06:42.688 --> 00:06:44.576
What do I do, what do I do?!

00:06:44.576 --> 00:06:47.744
Well for starters you might want to
take down that poster.

00:06:50.144 --> 00:06:50.991
Ladies and gentlemen...

00:06:50.991 --> 00:06:52.136
The incident occurred outside...

00:06:52.136 --> 00:06:53.760
Karakura Station
"Mysterious explosion of the building"

00:06:54.176 --> 00:06:55.648
just after 7:30 a.m

00:06:55.776 --> 00:06:57.280
as the morning commute was
getting into full swing.

00:06:57.600 --> 00:06:59.936
Witnesses reported hearing a loud crash,
and feeling the ground shake.

00:07:00.192 --> 00:07:02.624
The walls of several buildings
were cracked in this way.

00:07:03.296 --> 00:07:05.312
-But we have no casualties reported.
-Good morning Ichigo!

00:07:05.792 --> 00:07:07.280
Morning. Where’s Dad?

00:07:07.488 --> 00:07:09.952
Early meeting said he’d be
late tonight too.

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:11.616
-Really?
-We now have confirmed some IDs.

00:07:11.808 --> 00:07:12.832
Explosives experts are...

00:07:12.992 --> 00:07:14.230
reportedly on the scene...

00:07:14.230 --> 00:07:16.640
to research the reasons of the explosion.

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:17.536
Something bad happen?

00:07:17.920 --> 00:07:18.816
That’s near here.

00:07:20.032 --> 00:07:22.656
"Authorized Personnel Only"

00:07:40.608 --> 00:07:41.728
Listen... do you hear that sound?

00:07:42.624 --> 00:07:43.936
What sound? I don’t hear anything

00:07:47.296 --> 00:07:48.256
run!

00:07:56.130 --> 00:07:57.472
What's that?

00:07:58.144 --> 00:07:59.232
Help me!

00:07:59.808 --> 00:08:00.704
Run!

00:08:03.872 --> 00:08:04.849
What is that monster?!

00:08:04.849 --> 00:08:05.728
I don’t know!

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:10.817
Come on get up, get up!

00:08:46.013 --> 00:08:46.944
Whoa…

00:08:46.944 --> 00:08:47.936
What happened?

00:08:48.300 --> 00:08:49.824
Another explosion?

00:08:50.048 --> 00:08:51.100
Why?

00:08:52.768 --> 00:08:53.920
Look, over there.

00:08:54.144 --> 00:08:55.584
The walls cracked.

00:09:09.824 --> 00:09:10.944
I can't figure it out.

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:13.984
Who was she?

00:09:26.944 --> 00:09:28.338
Who are you?

00:09:33.504 --> 00:09:35.648
What do you want?

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:44.960
Close.

00:09:45.248 --> 00:09:47.200
Close what, you fool!

00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:52.160
Scared people to death and ignored them.

00:09:52.288 --> 00:09:53.600
Who are you and what do you want?!

00:09:53.600 --> 00:09:54.464
You hear me?

00:09:55.168 --> 00:09:57.664
Are you saying you can see me?

00:09:58.336 --> 00:09:59.680
You kicked me!

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:02.624
What the hell are you talking about?

00:10:02.624 --> 00:10:03.584
I'm confused.

00:10:04.544 --> 00:10:05.696
Of course I can see you.

00:10:05.696 --> 00:10:08.200
You were the one I saw
in town earlier I remember.

00:10:08.576 --> 00:10:09.696
Boy, nothing gets by you.

00:10:10.464 --> 00:10:11.392
This is strange.

00:10:11.616 --> 00:10:12.480
you look normal

00:10:12.480 --> 00:10:14.720
but you must be defective in some way.

00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:17.728
I’ll show you defect!

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:21.376
Who are you!?

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:22.912
You want to know?

00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:26.816
I’m a Soul Reaper.

00:10:33.856 --> 00:10:35.328
Oh no not again!

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:49.696
Alright. So you’re something
called a “Soul Reaper”

00:10:50.816 --> 00:10:53.152
And you say that you were sent here
by something called the Soul Society

00:10:53.440 --> 00:10:56.160
To deal with demons like that one...

00:10:56.544 --> 00:10:59.520
we saw on the street today...

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:01.696
...which was chasing after
that girl’s soul.

00:11:02.336 --> 00:11:03.744
It’s all believable to me…

00:11:04.070 --> 00:11:06.110
…along with flying pigs
and the tooth fairy!!

00:11:06.880 --> 00:11:07.872
You’ve got nerve.

00:11:08.128 --> 00:11:09.440
Why wouldn’t you believe in Soul Reapers

00:11:09.664 --> 00:11:11.872
even though you admitted
you can see ghosts!

00:11:12.256 --> 00:11:13.344
What?

00:11:13.472 --> 00:11:14.368
Excuse me,

00:11:14.368 --> 00:11:17.248
I’ve never seen or heard of
Soul Reapers before

00:11:17.632 --> 00:11:20.032
and frankly your whole story
is just too incredible.

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:21.920
I don’t believe in anything I can’t see.

00:11:22.624 --> 00:11:23.520
Listen up,

00:11:23.520 --> 00:11:25.664
well that’s true and I’ll give you
that you’re not human.

00:11:26.112 --> 00:11:28.768
But you go play your soul reaper
game somewhere else.

00:11:28.992 --> 00:11:31.360
Okay little brat?

00:11:32.512 --> 00:11:33.504
I’m a brat?

00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:35.424
Bakudo number one!

00:11:36.288 --> 00:11:37.160
Sai!

00:11:40.416 --> 00:11:41.260
I can’t move!

00:11:41.568 --> 00:11:42.912
What did you do to me?!

00:11:44.140 --> 00:11:45.024
I cannot move.

00:11:45.888 --> 00:11:47.456
I’ve used what’s called a Kido on you.

00:11:48.064 --> 00:11:50.976
It’s a high-level incantation
only we Soul Reapers can cast.

00:11:51.360 --> 00:11:52.576
I may appear young to you…

00:11:52.576 --> 00:11:54.976
but I have lived nearly
ten of your lifetimes.

00:11:55.328 --> 00:11:56.992
So you, little brat,

00:11:57.632 --> 00:11:59.183
I'm not let you die.

00:11:59.776 --> 00:12:01.440
But my principle has always been...

00:12:01.440 --> 00:12:03.872
not to touch anyone outside the order.

00:12:04.448 --> 00:12:06.240
Be grateful! Brat.

00:12:07.072 --> 00:12:08.240
That's going too far.

00:12:08.480 --> 00:12:09.344
And now…

00:12:18.272 --> 00:12:19.488
It’s that ghost from yesterday!

00:12:20.256 --> 00:12:24.576
No! I don’t want to be sent to
the underworld!

00:12:25.088 --> 00:12:26.080
You needn’t worry.

00:12:26.688 --> 00:12:29.056
You’re not bound for the underworld

00:12:29.664 --> 00:12:30.912
but instead for the Soul Society.

00:12:31.552 --> 00:12:33.792
There, your soul will be at peace.

00:12:43.616 --> 00:12:45.280
Where did he go?

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:49.632
I sent his spirit to the Soul Society.

00:12:50.432 --> 00:12:51.776
In your words,

00:12:51.936 --> 00:12:53.312
“passing on”

00:12:54.208 --> 00:12:55.904
One of the two main responsibilities
of a Soul Reaper.

00:12:56.896 --> 00:12:59.776
Now I’ll explain to you why I’m here...

00:12:59.968 --> 00:13:01.312
and I’ll use small words
so you can understand.

00:13:03.360 --> 00:13:06.464
Listen carefully, there are
two types of spirits in this world.

00:13:07.328 --> 00:13:08.192
"Wholes, good spirits"

00:13:08.192 --> 00:13:09.952
The first kind are the normal spirits
called Wholes.

00:13:10.688 --> 00:13:12.352
The ghosts that you see
are usually this kind.

00:13:13.568 --> 00:13:16.480
“Hollows, evil spirits”
The second kind are Hollows.

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:18.210
The Hollows attack people
living or dead,

00:13:18.210 --> 00:13:19.584
in order to devour their souls

00:13:19.584 --> 00:13:20.896
Those are evil spirits.

00:13:22.208 --> 00:13:24.032
Any questions before I go on?

00:13:24.256 --> 00:13:25.120
First of all,

00:13:25.376 --> 00:13:28.480
why do your drawings suck so bad?

00:13:32.992 --> 00:13:34.016
Aughh! Wait ‘til I get my hands on you!

00:13:34.400 --> 00:13:36.992
Let us continue with our lesson, Monsieu.

00:13:36.992 --> 00:13:38.016
Monsieur?

00:13:38.016 --> 00:13:40.448
As I said Soul Reapers have
two main jobs.

00:13:40.992 --> 00:13:41.888
The first is...

00:13:41.888 --> 00:13:45.376
to lead Wholes to the Soul Society by
performing “Konso”, as I did just now

00:13:45.792 --> 00:13:48.512
The second is to exorcise the
Hollows wherever we find them

00:13:48.512 --> 00:13:49.664
the Hollows wherever we find them

00:13:50.112 --> 00:13:53.184
That Hollow with the bug-body this
afternoon why was it chasing the girl?

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:54.624
That I don’t know.

00:13:55.392 --> 00:13:56.320
We have yet to fully understand

00:13:56.512 --> 00:13:59.584
what motivates the Hollows
to do the things they do

00:14:08.768 --> 00:14:09.824
Right,

00:14:10.464 --> 00:14:14.464
an especially tasty soul.

00:14:16.032 --> 00:14:20.064
It’s nearby with the smell of
a Soul Reaper!

00:14:29.152 --> 00:14:30.048
Huh? What was that?!

00:14:30.336 --> 00:14:31.220
One thing we do know

00:14:31.392 --> 00:14:34.368
there is still a second Hollow
prowling somewhere nearby.

00:14:34.976 --> 00:14:37.600
Then what the hell are you waiting?
Go out and kill it!

00:14:38.976 --> 00:14:40.032
I would but...

00:14:40.320 --> 00:14:41.888
Somehow...

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:44.896
I can’t seem to detect its location...

00:14:45.856 --> 00:14:49.120
as if my senses are being jammed
by some powerful force near here.

00:14:49.120 --> 00:14:50.080
What are you... deaf?

00:14:50.752 --> 00:14:52.128
There’s something huge howling
out there!

00:14:52.704 --> 00:14:54.048
It has to be a Hollow!

00:14:55.264 --> 00:14:57.920
Something howling?... What do you mean?

00:15:00.352 --> 00:15:01.216
Now I hear it!

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:04.544
Definitely a Hollow!

00:15:04.736 --> 00:15:05.632
You sure you know what you are doing?!

00:15:07.264 --> 00:15:08.160
That’s Yuzu!

00:15:08.384 --> 00:15:09.248
Hey, wait! Untie me!

00:15:12.320 --> 00:15:13.536
This spiritual pressure is among the
strongest I’ve ever felt!

00:15:14.240 --> 00:15:16.096
How could I not have sensed it earlier?

00:15:16.576 --> 00:15:17.504
How?

00:15:18.144 --> 00:15:19.488
Ichigo.

00:15:23.392 --> 00:15:24.320
Yuzu.

00:15:27.776 --> 00:15:28.683
Karin’s been...

00:15:29.408 --> 00:15:30.304
Ichigo!

00:15:31.488 --> 00:15:34.720
You’ve got to save her!

00:15:36.384 --> 00:15:37.344
Hey! You’ve got to let me go!

00:15:42.272 --> 00:15:43.680
Damn...

00:15:49.344 --> 00:15:51.104
Hey! Grr... got to break free!

00:15:56.448 --> 00:15:57.312
Stay out of it!

00:15:58.620 --> 00:15:59.488
Karin!

00:16:00.800 --> 00:16:01.696
Damn it!

00:16:03.264 --> 00:16:05.376
Moving his legs despite the Kido?!

00:16:07.168 --> 00:16:08.576
You fool!... you’ll only get in the way!

00:16:08.928 --> 00:16:09.824
Shut up!

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:14.176
Karin!

00:16:17.312 --> 00:16:18.176
Stop.

00:16:18.304 --> 00:16:20.768
The Kido is too strong for
a human to break it!

00:16:21.140 --> 00:16:23.168
You’ll only cause damage to your
soul if you keep trying!

00:16:33.130 --> 00:16:35.648
What!? He’s breaking the Kido!

00:16:40.768 --> 00:16:41.632
Don’t do it!

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:46.304
Ichigo! Get outta here!

00:16:51.936 --> 00:16:52.789
Karin!

00:16:52.928 --> 00:16:54.368
I found you!

00:17:05.952 --> 00:17:06.848
Karin!

00:17:07.648 --> 00:17:08.544
Don’t worry,

00:17:09.728 --> 00:17:10.784
she’ll be alright…

00:17:10.784 --> 00:17:13.240
The Hollow left without devouring
either of your sisters’ souls.

00:17:13.728 --> 00:17:14.592
Are you sure?

00:17:14.848 --> 00:17:15.712
That’s right

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:17.664
It’s seeking a specific soul to eat

00:17:17.664 --> 00:17:19.494
one with a much higher
concentration of spirit energy.

00:17:20.992 --> 00:17:23.936
In fact, the Hollow earlier…

00:17:24.384 --> 00:17:26.784
...was hungry for that soul too
not the girl’s

00:17:27.360 --> 00:17:28.270
But why?

00:17:28.544 --> 00:17:29.792
No idea.

00:17:30.304 --> 00:17:31.936
For some reason, your spirit energy
was mostly hidden deep within you,

00:17:31.936 --> 00:17:34.176
until now when you
needed it to save your sister.

00:17:35.360 --> 00:17:38.720
That’s why I didn’t sense anything
unusual about you when I arrived,

00:17:38.912 --> 00:17:41.760
….. it also explains why
the Hollows didn’t come after you.

00:17:42.976 --> 00:17:43.836
I think...

00:17:44.192 --> 00:17:47.264
the spirit energy bottled up
inside you started to pour out...

00:17:47.872 --> 00:17:50.208
when you made contact with
that young girl’s ghost.

00:17:50.688 --> 00:17:52.524
As a result, your soul became exposed.

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:54.656
It means...

00:17:54.912 --> 00:17:59.072
Those two Hollows today detected
your soul through that girl

00:18:01.088 --> 00:18:02.784
and they were using her to track it down.

00:18:04.064 --> 00:18:06.208
The Hollows are really after you.

00:18:11.168 --> 00:18:12.416
It’s back! Get out of here!

00:18:12.544 --> 00:18:13.504
No!

00:18:14.090 --> 00:18:16.992
So the vicious attacks on
that girl were because of me?

00:18:17.216 --> 00:18:18.208
One way to look at it…

00:18:18.592 --> 00:18:19.744
And now both my sisters

00:18:19.744 --> 00:18:22.112
could wind up dead and
the whole thing is my fault?

00:18:22.464 --> 00:18:23.744
Help her! Ungh!

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:26.200
Ichigo! Do something!!

00:18:32.672 --> 00:18:35.488
You want my soul?

00:18:36.832 --> 00:18:39.360
Fight me one on one you ugly bastard!

00:19:02.144 --> 00:19:03.104
Soul Reaper!

00:19:06.208 --> 00:19:07.648
You are a fool.

00:19:10.464 --> 00:19:12.896
How could you possibly have thought
you were any match for a Hollow?

00:19:14.112 --> 00:19:15.584
You should know that.

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:20.096
Or you believe that...

00:19:20.928 --> 00:19:22.976
everything would be over
if you gave him your soul.

00:19:23.968 --> 00:19:25.200
If you don’t stop interfering...

00:19:25.696 --> 00:19:28.000
we’re all going to end up as its food.

00:19:38.176 --> 00:19:41.088
Do you really want to save your family?

00:19:42.464 --> 00:19:43.328
Sure.

00:19:44.416 --> 00:19:45.600
If there’s a way then tell me how!

00:19:46.720 --> 00:19:48.256
It will only be temporary...

00:19:51.328 --> 00:19:53.664
but you must become
a Soul Reaper yourself.

00:19:55.296 --> 00:19:58.240
You must take my zanpakuto
and run it through to your body...

00:19:58.976 --> 00:20:01.056
so that I may pour my powers into you.

00:20:03.872 --> 00:20:05.408
I can’t guarantee you’ll live

00:20:06.030 --> 00:20:07.936
but if it doesn’t work it won’t matter.

00:20:13.312 --> 00:20:15.712
Then give me that blade, Soul Reaper.

00:20:16.416 --> 00:20:17.696
My name is Rukia,

00:20:18.688 --> 00:20:19.904
Rukia Kuchiki.

00:20:25.088 --> 00:20:25.984
And I am…

00:20:27.808 --> 00:20:29.056
Ichigo Kurosaki!

00:20:46.016 --> 00:20:46.912
How could this have happened?!

00:20:49.216 --> 00:20:51.280
I meant to give him
only half of my powers...

00:20:51.712 --> 00:20:53.472
but somehow he’s taken all of it!

00:20:56.032 --> 00:20:57.216
What kind of being is he?

00:20:58.944 --> 00:20:59.840
I’ve never seen a human...

00:20:59.840 --> 00:21:01.280
with Spiritual Pressure this strong

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:03.648
that’s what was jamming
my senses before!

00:21:05.376 --> 00:21:06.432
I have never heard of a human...

00:21:06.432 --> 00:21:09.568
with strength enough to
break the Kido on his own!

00:21:12.416 --> 00:21:13.856
And I have never seen a Soul Reaper

00:21:14.464 --> 00:21:16.480
who wielded a Zanpakuto so huge!

00:21:16.773 --> 00:21:17.933
I have never seen...

00:21:21.696 --> 00:21:24.800
You will pay the price
for hurting my family.

00:21:25.504 --> 00:21:26.752
You Hollow scum.

00:21:37.664 --> 00:21:38.880
"Ichigo Kurosaki 15 years old"

00:21:38.880 --> 00:21:39.840
"Hair color orange"

00:21:39.840 --> 00:21:41.408
"Eye color brown"

00:21:41.408 --> 00:21:42.270
"Vocation high school students and"

00:21:42.270 --> 00:21:44.928
"Soul Reaper"

00:22:45.120 --> 00:22:47.160
Hey, how’re you all doing?

00:22:47.160 --> 00:22:50.688
This is the one you’d most like to
take home from the world of Soul Reaper!

00:22:50.688 --> 00:22:51.584
Yeah!

00:22:51.712 --> 00:22:53.664
Well it’s finally started
our high school Soul Reaper...

00:22:53.664 --> 00:22:56.320
is finding life sweet but painful,
slightly salty, heartfelt and...

00:22:56.320 --> 00:22:58.208
Hey, you don’t come in ‘til later!

00:22:58.688 --> 00:22:59.616
Oops... we’re out of time!